%% Phase 6b: landing page, login from the landing page, shared engineers' session, logout back to the landing page
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Browser
  participant Home as home.localtest.me (public)
  participant GW as Envoy Gateway (OIDC filter)
  participant KC as Keycloak (sso.localtest.me)
  participant App as Status page / shop

  rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over U,App: Customer: "Customer login" on the landing page
    U->>Home: GET / (no login)
    U->>GW: GET https://shop.localtest.me/ (full-page link)
    GW-->>U: 302 to Keycloak, realm customers (no shop session)
    U->>KC: branded login page (Keycloakify theme shd-shop), sign in or register
    KC-->>U: 302 /oauth2/callback?code=...
    U->>GW: callback
    GW->>KC: code -> tokens
    GW-->>U: shop session cookies (host shop.localtest.me), 302 to /
    U->>App: shop with the gateway session (no token in JavaScript)
  end

  rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over U,App: Engineer: the status page shell is public, its /api needs the session
    U->>GW: GET https://status.localtest.me/ (public files)
    U->>GW: fetch /api/v1/me (X-Requested-With: fetch)
    alt session cookies on .localtest.me (e.g. after Prometheus)
      GW->>App: forward + access token -> data, "Signed in as ..."
    else no session
      GW-->>U: 401 -> page shows "Login"
      U->>GW: GET /login (full page)
      GW-->>U: 302 to Keycloak, realm ops (default theme)
      U->>KC: password, or none if Keycloak already has a session (Grafana)
      KC-->>U: 302 /oauth2/callback -> session cookies on .localtest.me -> 302 /login -> 302 /
    end
  end

  rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
    Note over U,KC: Logout (status page, landing page or shop)
    U->>GW: GET /oauth2/logout
    GW-->>U: delete session cookies, 302 to end_session_endpoint<br/>id_token_hint, client_id, post_logout_redirect_uri=https://home.localtest.me/
    U->>KC: RP-initiated logout (Keycloak session ended)
    KC-->>U: 302 https://home.localtest.me/ (registered post-logout URI)
    U->>Home: landing page, the next protected page asks for the password again
  end
